# Citation metadata for ARPAHLS/aura.
# Validate: pip install cffconvert && cffconvert -i CITATION.cff -f apalike
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  Record the aura-harness version you used (PyPI or Git tag) for reproducibility.
type: software
title: AURA Harness
abstract: >-
  AURA Harness is an open-source Python runtime coat for agent loops. It wraps
  existing hosts with a membrane model — ingress context, egress policy on tool
  calls, prescriptive sequencer pipelines, observers, hash-chained audit trails,
  conformance summaries, and structured audit reports — without replacing the
  user's loop, model, or skill runtime.
version: "0.3.3"
date-released: "2026-08-21"
license: MIT
